---
export const prerender = false;
---

<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>AnimePahe Iframe Test</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; background: #0a0517; color: white; font-family: sans-serif; }
    h1 { color: #c084fc; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .test-box { margin: 30px 0; padding: 20px; background: rgba(28, 15, 61, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; }
    .test-box h3 { margin: 0 0 10px; color: #e879f9; }
    .test-box p { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 13px; opacity: 0.8; }
    iframe { width: 100%; height: 600px; border: 0; border-radius: 8px; background: #000; margin-top: 10px; display: block; }
    .url { font-family: monospace; font-size: 11px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3); padding: 8px; border-radius: 6px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 8px 0; color: #7dd3fc; }
    .highlight { background: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.15); border-color: rgba(251, 191, 36, 0.5); }
    .success { background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15); border-color: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.5); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>🎯 AnimePahe.ch Iframe Test</h1>
  <p>Checking if AnimePahe embeds work in an iframe.</p>

  <div class="test-box highlight">
    <h3>🔥 Test A: YOUR URL (Oblivious Saint - Ep 7)</h3>
    <p>Your provided URL — direct episode page</p>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ch/the-oblivious-saint-cant-contain-her-power-episode-7-english-subbed/</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ch/the-oblivious-saint-cant-contain-her-power-episode-7-english-subbed/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test B: AnimePahe.ch Homepage</h3>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ch/</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ch/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test C: One Piece Ep 1 (guessing URL pattern)</h3>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ch/one-piece-episode-1-english-subbed/</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ch/one-piece-episode-1-english-subbed/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box">
    <h3>Test D: Jujutsu Kaisen Ep 1</h3>
    <div class="url">https://animepahe.ch/jujutsu-kaisen-episode-1-english-subbed/</div>
    <iframe src="https://animepahe.ch/jujutsu-kaisen-episode-1-english-subbed/" sandbox="allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-forms allow-popups"></iframe>
  </div>

  <div class="test-box success">
    <h3>✅ What to Check:</h3>
    <ol>
      <li><strong>Test A (YOUR URL):</strong> Video/page dekhachche? MOST IMPORTANT!</li>
      <li><strong>Test B (Homepage):</strong> AnimePahe homepage load?</li>
      <li><strong>Test C (One Piece):</strong> URL pattern kaj kore?</li>
      <li><strong>Test D (Jujutsu Kaisen):</strong> Same test</li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
